Original commit body from bfe5ba4:

cmd_test_coverage was only counting direct test→target calls, giving
~30% coverage when the actual transitive coverage was ~90%.

Changes:
- Add compute_transitive_test_coverage() helper to ranking.py
  - Shared BFS algorithm for transitive test reachability
  - If test_foo() calls helper() which calls core(), both are "tested"
- Update cmd_test_coverage to use the shared helper
- Update _estimate_test_coverage in sketch.py to use the shared helper

This ensures both `hypergumbo test-coverage` and `hypergumbo sketch`
report consistent coverage percentages using the same algorithm.
